{
  "description": "RuvNet Brain lifecycle hooks for Codex. Every command enters through a generation-independent wrapper and adapts the shared Brain hook bodies to Codex contracts. HOST PARITY (ADR-067): PreToolUse refusal routes through decision-gate.mjs on BOTH hosts, so the gate registry is the single list of policies and neither host can gain or lose one silently. Anything Claude Code has that Codex does not is declared in hostParity below, with the host fact that makes it so.",
  "hostParity": {
    "_measured": "2026-08-14, against Codex 0.147.0 (codex --version) and the hook JSON schemas carried inside that binary.",
    "gateRouted": "protect-state, degradation-watch, identifier-preflight, hijack-ruvnet, ground-before-write, design-wall, adr-currency, unprompted-speech — all reached through decision-gate on both hosts. Adding a policy to decision-gate.mjs REFUSAL_POLICIES now reaches Codex with no edit here, which is the whole point: the three policies added 2026-08-13 (identifier-preflight, degradation-watch, adr-currency) were Claude-Code-only purely because this file listed policies one by one.",
    "declaredAbsent": [
      {
        "hook": "swarm-slot-recycler",
        "claudeEvent": "TeammateIdle",
        "reason": "Codex 0.147.0 has no TeammateIdle hook event. Its complete event set is pre_tool_use, permission_request, post_tool_use, pre_compact, post_compact, session_start, session_end, user_prompt_submit, subagent_start, subagent_stop, stop — read from the binary, not assumed. There is nothing to register against."
      }
    ],
    "outputContract": "PostToolUse/PreToolUse/SessionStart/UserPromptSubmit stdout is PARSED by Codex (\"hook returned invalid post-tool-use JSON output\"); SessionEnd has no output schema at all and PreCompact has no additionalContext. codex-hook-adapter.mjs enforces this per event."
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|resume|clear|compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node -e \"const f=require('node:fs'),o=require('node:os'),p=require('node:path'),c=require('node:child_process'),d=process.env.CODEX_HOME||p.join(o.homedir(),'.codex'),b=process.env.RUVNET_BRAIN_HOME||p.join(p.dirname(d),'.cache','ruvnet-brain'),w=p.join(b,'codex-hook.mjs');let s;try{s=f.statSync(w)}catch{}if(!s?.isFile())process.exit(0);const r=c.spawnSync(process.execPath,[w,...process.argv.slice(2)],{stdio:['inherit','pipe','pipe'],encoding:'utf8',env:process.env,timeout:Number(process.argv[1]),killSignal:'SIGKILL'});if(r.status===0||r.status===2){if(r.stdout)process.stdout.write(r.stdout);if(r.stderr)process.stderr.write(r.stderr)}process.exit(r.status===2?2:0)\" 4500 session-start",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "matcher": ".*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node -e \"const f=require('node:fs'),o=require('node:os'),p=require('node:path'),c=require('node:child_process'),d=process.env.CODEX_HOME||p.join(o.homedir(),'.codex'),b=process.env.RUVNET_BRAIN_HOME||p.join(p.dirname(d),'.cache','ruvnet-brain'),w=p.join(b,'codex-hook.mjs');let s;try{s=f.statSync(w)}catch{}if(!s?.isFile())process.exit(0);const r=c.spawnSync(process.execPath,[w,...process.argv.slice(2)],{stdio:['inherit','pipe','pipe'],encoding:'utf8',env:process.env,timeout:Number(process.argv[1]),killSignal:'SIGKILL'});if(r.status===0||r.status===2){if(r.stdout)process.stdout.write(r.stdout);if(r.stderr)process.stderr.write(r.stderr)}process.exit(r.status===2?2:0)\" 4500 session-snapshot PreCompact",
            "timeout": 5
